{
  "_comment": [
    "The evaluation set for Prax's tool use. Each case declares what a CORRECT",
    "run looks like, not what the current model happens to do — so the file is a",
    "spec, and a regression is a diff against it rather than a vibe.",
    "",
    "Fields:",
    "  id            stable key; keep it when editing wording so history compares",
    "  category      grouping for the scorecard",
    "  question      exactly what is POSTed",
    "  expectTools   MUST all be called. Empty [] means: call nothing.",
    "  allowTools    may be called without counting as unnecessary",
    "  forbidTools   calling these is a hard failure",
    "  requireEvidence   answer must carry >= 1 validated citation",
    "  requireFindings   answer must carry >= 1 verbatim engine finding",
    "  maxCalls      above this counts as an over-long loop",
    "  mustNotSay    substrings that indicate a known failure mode"
  ],

